-- =========================================================
-- 08. REVIEW NOTES
-- Muc dich:
--   Nhung diem can review truoc khi coi init_new.sql la execution path chinh.
-- =========================================================

-- 1. Xac nhan runtime init co ho tro SOURCE file tuong doi.
-- 2. Xac nhan dict_metric_profile co the ket noi:
--      HOST localhost
--      PORT 9000
--      DB telemetry_db
--      USER root
--      PASSWORD password
-- 3. Xac nhan kieu du lieu series_key:
--      telemetry_metrics.series_key dang la String
--      latest/aggregate tables dang dung UInt64
--    Hien tai cac MV dang ep toUInt64(series_key) de giong source-of-truth.
-- 4. Xac nhan policy seed da phu metric can dung cho node/current/1m/5m.
-- 5. Xac nhan dict_node_topology da co rack_id truoc khi ky vong rack-serving co du lieu.
-- 6. Xac nhan rack_summary_history duoc backfill neu can lich su truoc thoi diem tao MV.
